  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conversion project for replacement of HFC-134a with isobutane (R 600a)/propane (R-290)-based refrigerant in the manufacture of domestic and commercial refrigeration equipment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will eliminate the annual consumption of 96.55 metric tonnes (mt) (138,069 of CO2 tonnes) of HFC-134a at the three domestic and commercial refrigeration equipment manufacturing enterprises - Briket S.A. (Briket), Talleres Metalurgicos Bambi (Bambi), and Mabe-Kronen Int. SRL (Mabe-Kronen). The energy efficiency of the domestic refrigerators will also increase by at least 20 per cent t hrough changes in the refrigerant, and equipment design and components.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Protocol HFC</narrative>
  </participating-org>
